176
00:10:26.217 --> 00:10:27.987
Decision, and Choice, and Why.

177
00:10:28.267 --> 00:10:29.441
ARI model.

178
00:10:29.721 --> 00:10:30.553
Choice:

179
00:10:30.833 --> 00:10:39.707
Per property times room type times rate plan times date, with range updates and restrictions (min stay, closed to arrival or departure).

180
00:10:39.987 --> 00:10:40.670
Why:

181
00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:42.443
Matches how hotels sell.

182
00:10:42.723 --> 00:10:43.619
Search path.

183
00:10:43.899 --> 00:10:44.731
Choice:

184
00:10:45.011 --> 00:10:53.587
Two stages: candidate retrieval from the geo or attribute index, then availability and price from an in-memory cache, then ranking.

185
00:10:53.867 --> 00:10:54.550
