586
00:40:03.925 --> 00:40:21.461
Consumer protection: transparent total prices including taxes and fees;. clear cancellation policies;. grievance officer requirements under the E-commerce Rules (VERIFY);. drip pricing and dark patterns guidelines (VERIFY CCPA guidelines on dark patterns).

587
00:40:22.811 --> 00:40:32.646
