594
00:40:59.814 --> 00:41:00.731
Booking path.

595
00:41:01.011 --> 00:41:07.731
Highest priority: separate capacity, circuit breakers on partner calls, and a status query before retry.

596
00:41:08.011 --> 00:41:09.611
Booking delivery monitoring.

597
00:41:09.891 --> 00:41:14.883
Alerts for undelivered bookings, and a manual phone or email fallback to hotels.

598
00:41:15.163 --> 00:41:16.251
