599
00:41:16.531 --> 00:41:20.414
New Year and long weekends bring traffic spikes and supply scarcity.

600
00:41:20.694 --> 00:41:23.958
Pre-scale, warm caches and watch price mismatch rates.

601
00:41:25.308 --> 00:41:26.716
Partner reliability.

602
00:41:26.996 --> 00:41:32.180
Per-partner circuit breakers, plus marking properties as on request when their live checks fail.

603
00:41:32.460 --> 00:41:39.777
Observability: search latency per stage;. price mismatch rate;. sold-out-at-booking rate;. overbooking incidents;.

604
00:41:40.057 --> 00:41:41.700
